Description: stream Icinga2 events and performance data to Splunk
 Subscribes to the Icinga2 API event stream and forwards state changes,
 notifications, acknowledgements, comments, downtimes and performance data
 to Splunk through the HTTP Event Collector (HEC).
 .
 Events are batched and retried, and buffered in a size- and age-limited
 disk spool while Splunk is unavailable.
